A '''Scythe Blade''' is a {{Legendary}} item. It is unlocked at {{Coll|Zombie Slayer 7}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
A '''Scythe Blade''' is a {{Odds|pray}} drop from the {{Stier|4}} {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} and {{Stier|5}} {{MobSprite|Atoned Horror}}.

;Drop Chances
* {{Stier|4}}: {{Green|0.06%}} ({{Green|1}}/{{Yellow|1761}})
* {{Stier|5}}: {{Green|0.1%}} ({{Green|1/}}{{Yellow|968}})

